  "description": {
   "en": "The apocalypse has arrived—devastation spreads, and human civilization teeters on the brink of collapse.\nAs the director of the last shelter, I bear the heavy responsibility of restoring hope for humanity!\"\n\n\"CEOs, electricians, programmers—do you think your skills are useless in the apocalypse?\nDon’t worry! Come to my underground shelter and assist me.\n\nWe need you!"
